    "rationale": "Conservative raw-grounded mapping: stable identifiers and text content on SocialPost entity; mutable engagement counters (view/star/share/like/comment) on SocialPostObservation. blogger_name promoted to hasAuthor relation targeting TwitterAccount entity with displayName label property; avatar_url retained as denormalized authorAvatarUrl on entity since scalar subject is limited to entity|observation. institution_infos object array mapped as mentionsInstitution relation to Institution entity (assumed nested fields /institution_id and /institution_name). strategic_tag_ids string array mapped as hasStrategicTag relation to StrategicTag concept using the tag id itself as both identifier and label. image_urls and video_urls kept as multi-valued datatype properties per contract since media URLs are not among the listed semantic array types requiring typed-node relations."
